        "review_bGXC7T": {
          "type": "Review",
          "settings": {
            "description": "I don't know what i would do with my SPORTea®! I drink in continually throughout the day, and I have done so for years. It is the one, perfect indulgence that has no down side... it keeps me hydrated, satisfied, so easy to make, tastes great while it provides only healthy ingredients. I can't think of another food or drink that has these attributes. Please don't ever stop making this product!",
